   "evidence": "Same valid row: r2 -> `NOT-SAFE none obsidian=no-matching-ledger-row`; impl-24 -> `NOT-VERIFIED(no-ledger-row)`; with a trailing newline added both flip to SAFE/VERIFIED. impl-20 and impl-21 read the unterminated line correctly (impl-21 `SAFE moved-to-obsidian`)."
  },
